Package: m6APrediction
Type: Package
Title: Predict m6A RNA Modification Sites from Sequence Features
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Tongyue", family = "Zhao",
    email = "Tongyue.Zhao24@student.xjtlu.edu.cn", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides sequence-feature encoding and random-forest scoring of
    N6-methyladenosine (m6A) candidate sites. The package wraps the model
    trained in the BIO215 practicals on seven sequence-derived features,
    returns a per-site probability and a binary m6A status for one or many
    candidate sites, and ships the fitted model together with an example
    feature table in inst/extdata.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: randomForest, stats
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Suggests: knitr, rmarkdown
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
